Namespace private BBR identifiers in custom TCP congestion controls.

Each copied BBR implementation formerly contributed identically named static
functions and types to vmlinux. Pahole omitted the ambiguous functions from
BTF, leaving stock BBRv3 kfunc IDs unresolved and preventing registration of
the stock bbr congestion control. Keep TCP algorithm names and TCP_INFO ABI.

